ions","fact":"source.imgw.license_statement","verification_status":"verified_public_recording"},{"kind":"citation","exact_text":"Udostępnienie i korzystanie z danych następuje pod warunkiem wskazania źródła pochodzenia danych, poprzez umieszczenie przez korzystającego na wszelkiego rodzaju pracach lub produktach, opracowanych z użyciem danych IMGW-PIB informacji: „Źródłem pochodzenia danych jest Instytut Meteorologii i Gospodarki Wodnej – Państwowy Instytut Badawczy”.","recording_id":"pl_imgw_terms_regulations","fact":"source.imgw.citation_statement","verification_status":"verified_public_recording"}]},{"source_id":"sr.pl.grdc","issuer":"Global Runoff Data Centre","operator":"Bundesanstalt für Gewässerkunde","evidence":[],"statements":[{"kind":"access","recording_id":null,"verification_status":"verified_private_forwarded_copy","private_verification":{"schema_version":2,"statement_id":"pl_imgw.grdc.inclusion","evidence_kind":"forwarded_copy","limitation":"original_byte_identity_not_established","evidence_sha256":"6ffc840e3a371cc7731fdd587e3d3a3918e47aa73c0e7e1c1251e54494054742","evidence_byte_count":228628,"workbook_sha256":"dfab6ea7de80fb1570f4a8dded8743ed7c7dcb4eb67fe75e2c0e02e9b964b7bf","workbook_byte_count":116301,"statement_sha256":"a95a0e6b9f0f26c87b2d04e02098b3c0dbc24525bdd75b17dfddfa0cd0c443c2","decoded_text_plain_occurrence_count":1,"decoded_text_html_occurrence_count":1,"verified":true}}]}],"descriptions":["CODZ units/daily fields and yearbook station-dependent methods; archive-wide statistics remain unestablished","IMGW public station roster and API documentation establish provider membership and the station-product availability statement; the roster contains no geometry","IMGW public-data regulations HTML recording","Observation archive requests are acquired from IMGW at runtime","Recovered station table is raw-byte identical to the upstream materialization; the commit instant is a provenance lower bound, not an original receipt instant","Later GRDC workb